# SwiftFormat (docs/CI.md). CI runs `swiftformat --lint .`; `make format` applies it.
# A deliberately small rule set the code already follows, so the check guards the
# style instead of rewriting it. Widen it in its own commit: enable a rule here,
# run `make format`, commit the result.
--swiftversion 5.10
--exclude build,.build,DerivedData,Ryft.xcodeproj
--rules trailingSpace,linebreakAtEndOfFile,consecutiveBlankLines,duplicateImports,semicolons,todos,spaceAroundComments
--indent 4
--maxwidth 160
